@0    = ~Hmm, what's this, then? Naga's skin?~
@1    = ~By Moradin, that's quite a material ye've got! I think I may have some use for it. I could craft ye an armor usin' the skin and a scroll of Protecton from Poison. This work would cost ye 15,000 gold pieces, but ye should know that it's worth it. The naga's skin is a elastic material, so the armor itself will allow ye to stay as swift as a weasel. Are you interested?~
@2    = ~Let's do it.~
@3    = ~Maybe not now. Is there something else you can forge?~
@4    = ~Fine. Let's see what else have you got.~
@5    = ~Well, there ye go, me friend. Use it well. And if ye comes across anything else of interest, ye knows where to bring it, aye?~
